# README media: DUSKLING. Replays the recorded routes of the dk_r tests
# (plain button presses) and grabs frames on the way.
shotscale 2
wipe_saves
game duskling
wait 60
shot duskling_title
# the dayling comes down into the dusk wood (dk_16)
press A
wait 50
shot duskling_dusk
